  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私、『破天荒』って言葉が好きなのよ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………詳細、いいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あら、わからない？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "今まで誰もしたことのないことをする──\r\nどう？　素敵だと思わない？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それでね、私なら──\r\n放課後クライマックスガールズなら──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "『破天荒』を体現することができるって、\r\n私は思うのよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だって、私たちは既にここまで走ってきているんだもの！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "最初は誰も、私たちに注目も期待もしていなかった──\r\nでも、今では違う",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私たちを応援してくれる人も、楽しみに待っててくれる人も\r\nたくさんいるわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな\r\n夏葉らしい理由で、納得したよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ、それならよかったわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……夏葉って、\r\n子どもの頃からそういう考えだったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……どうだったかしらね\r\n私にとっては、自然なことだし……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあもう、物心ついた時には夏葉は夏葉だったのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "さすがにそれだけ昔だと\r\nはっきり意識してはいなかったと思うけど……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だんだんと、大人の言うことがわかるようになるじゃない？\r\n期待されていることも、そうでないことも……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だから、『じゃあ見せてあげる』って\r\n気持ちになって……そのうち、私は私になったのよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013002010140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……うふふ\r\nアナタにも見せたいものがたくさんあるわ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300201/1013002010140"
  },
  {
